    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "本条只写 Loughran/Wellman《New Evidence on the Financialization of Commodity Markets》（JFQA 2011）Enterprise Multiple之可钉十分位多空（OpenSourceAP EntMult可执行核，非目录字段）。EntMult=(mve_permco+DLTT+DLC+DC−CHE)/OIBDP；剔除CEQ<0或OIBDP<0。每年6月末按EntMult分十分位；等权做多最低十分位、做空最高十分位，持有12月。Sign为负。不是French·EP/CFP近核；不是本批OScore。代码与SignalDoc：LSQuantile=0.1、StockWeight=EW、PortfolioPeriod=12、StartMonth=6。"
    },
